WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.190
My people! Today na history!

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.750
I don become Papa — officially!

3
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.750
Felix, abeg — na six months I carry am.

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.250
Election wey I win! Landslide!

5
00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:17.900
Mama, we get news… Ada dey pregnant! Six
months!

6
00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:25.240
Six months? And una dey tell me today?

7
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:29.520
Mama, we wan make sure everything dey okay
first…

8
00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.790
Make sure of what?

9
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.310
Say na Felix get am?

10
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.930
Mama! Ah-ah!

11
00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:43.330
Woman wey just come, marry my only son —
now belle don show.

12
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.490
In this Lagos, person must ask.

13
00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.910
Mama, I respect you.

14
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.430
This baby na your grandchild.

15
00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.450
We go see. DNA go talk.

16
00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:57.500
Babe, she no mean am… Mama na comedian.

17
00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:01.120
Felix, you be the only comedian for this
house.

18
00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:05.810
Meow… Mama brain dey suspicious.

19
00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:07.610
Nobody go insult my pikin.

20
00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.430
Nobody. I swear.

21
00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:14.770
Felix, carry my load. From today, I dey
stay here.

22
00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:17.550
The Lord has sent her… to watch.

23
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.600
Na so the trouble start.
